{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S06等段落的感受提示密集，尤其短时段里需要同时追踪人物话语和音乐变化，扫读负担明显高于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词把每段人物心理的核心抓出来，又通过分时出现的感受提示，把音乐变化和人物内心的变化对应起来，尤其能让人看见从舍不得、受伤、怀疑到接受想念并继续生活的连续过程。X的双栏结构更清爽，扫一眼就能建立话语和感受的对应关系，但右侧不少词组更像情绪标签，缺少Y那种具体的身体反应、音乐细节和情绪转折，因此综合体验我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "30bf467e-5d5a-4b9e-945f-14c826a21c0d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T012008007126Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:21:22.820491+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b6fc4caf1c4e32bd1b2ffaef8567990c5dd78f08e9fe8ffd125514da2b703b01", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "